      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n(4 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nSome concerns, see inline comments. The test37 failure against older servers seems to have already been fixed on the client side by 29bb9d7375 (\"LU-20623 llapi: find the parity comp before refusing a delete\"). If so, this gate is no longer needed, and it would hide the only interop coverage for that fix.",
