          "date": "2026-10-07 02:20:44.000000000",
          "tz": -360
        },
        "subject": "LU-12187 tests: skip llapi_layout_test 37 for old MDS",
        "message": "LU-12187 tests: skip llapi_layout_test 37 for old MDS\n\nsanity test_27D runs llapi_layout_test, whose subtest 37 (\"verify\nmirror count and mirror ids for existing files\") needs the arbitrary\nmirror id support added to the MDS in commit 5c24d600986b.  test_27D\ngates its other subtests on the server version but not this one, so an\ninterop run against an older server fails there unless the caller sets\nSKIP27D=\"-s 37\" by hand, which several patches now carry in their\nTest-Parameters.\n\nGate subtest 37 on the server version like the rest, so no caller\nneeds the exception.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity serverversion=2.17\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5.5 ltvm,llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I3247d501f24f04c853d727087ebceaa28b3ebbe5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
